# The failures of Felucca's host suite (fw/tests/run_tests.sh, AMEN_SETUP=0) that AMEN has and Felucca 1.9.0 has not,
# by tools/felucca_tests.sh: each line as its fails() prints it (numbers N, hashes H). A line starting with # is a
# comment. Every group below is AMEN's engine swap (engine 2 PHASE -> JUNGLE, engine 6 TRIO -> REESE; the engines shown
# JUNGLE REESE DRUM SLICE ANALOG FM6, fw/AMEN.md), none a fault of the firmware.

# fold155_test (PHASE's FOLD): built on PHASE's own types and constants (pd_t, ENG_PHASE, PD_FOLD_G0); AMEN has no
# PHASE, so it does not build (the suite goes on, fw/AMEN.md)
